9	better_way	{"body": "Event planners can feel expensive and overwhelming. Doing everything yourself can quickly become stressful. Elewen brings the best of both, thoughtful styling without the chaos.", "heading_1": "A Better Way Between", "heading_2": "Event and DIY", "left_label": "Event Planner", "right_label": "DIY", "left_description": "Full-service planning often comes with high costs and long coordination cycles. You rely on large teams, multiple approvals, and a process that can feel heavier than the event itself.", "right_description": "Planning everything yourself means juggling vendors, comparing prices, managing logistics, and making countless decisions. It quickly turns a celebration into a checklist.", "center_description": "The balance between structure and simplicity. You get curated d??cor, trusted vendors, and guided planning, without the pressure or the price of full-scale event management."}	6
10	packages_intro	{"body": "Celebrations became louder and bigger, but less personal. Elewen exists to bring that feeling back, not through more, but through meaning.", "heading_1": "Somewhere Between Moodboards", "heading_2": "and Reality, the Feeling Got Lost.", "section_heading": "Our Most Loved Packages"}	7
