45	founders	{"heading": "Meet the Founders", "founders": [{"name": "Hi! I'm Moksha", "paragraphs": ["I still don't fully know how a formerly shy kid has turned into an adult who now builds experiences around people, conversations, and connection, but here we are.", "I've lived a large part of my life at a boarding school, The Lawrence School, Sanawar, which has shaped me into an independent, creative and confident person obsessed with structure (yes, I make checklists in my personal life too). An obsession that turned out to be a superpower in the events world.", "After doing a Msc. In International Events from the UK, and spending years in the industry, I knew I didn't want to build just another event management company. I wanted to create something bigger.", "So, I left my dream job, took a leap of faith and Elewen was born."]}, {"name": "Hey! I'm Gauri", "paragraphs": ["I'm a dancer, reader, dreamer, and a believer that every little step eventually leads to the right place.", "I graduated from Ashoka university with an honours in economics and finance. Post-graduation, I was set to be buried in financial spreadsheets, but life had different plans.", "Elewen began as an idea my co-founder and I developed while exploring the opportunity to build a thoughtful, design-driven brand. Fast forward, and Elewen has grown into a full-time adventure, challenging me every day, keeping me on my toes and constantly inspired."]}]}	5
